  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt ½ the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.</li>\n• <li>Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.</li>\n• <li>Meanwhile, grate carrot. Drain and rinse kidney beans. </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf465e0e4e3eb769fd509/step-da2b5b00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. </li>\n• <li>Cook carrot until tender, 2-3 mins. Cook kidney beans until tender, 2-3 mins. Add<br>jerk seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.</li>\n• <li>Stir in coconut milk and the stock powder and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins. Remove from heat. Stir in remaining butter until melted.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf465e0e4e3eb769fd509/step-03066610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Meanwhile, finely chop tomato and coriander. Roughly chop cucumber.</li>\n• <li>In a medium bowl, combine tomato, cucumber, coriander and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season to taste with salt and pepper.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf465e0e4e3eb769fd509/step-78b9c020.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Divide garlic rice between bowls.</li>\n• <li>Top with coconut-jerk kidney beans and cucumber salsa to serve.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf465e0e4e3eb769fd509/step-ba359530.jpeg"
    }
  ]
